        "slc_afd7df36e58c6718329ee6989f8b923a4af929f6201904d85e87da2d4ee91aca"
      ],
      "text": "The desktop GUI and terminal TUI share a single local `kun serve` runtime, sharing threads, goals, plans, approvals, and background tasks rather than separate sessions."
    },
