      "text": "Kun is not tied to one model; presets cover ChatGPT/Codex, Claude, Gemini, Cursor, Ollama, DeepSeek, Kimi, GLM, Qwen, MiniMax, and Xiaomi MiMo ecosystems via provider configuration."
